title: Continuation
position: -375,774
---
<<set $Speaker to "CabbageCoral_sad">>
<<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
Cabbage Leather Coral: I think that's why all my friends find excuses to ditch me.
-> Yes I... do understand you. I too, felt somewhat alienated with my sharky pals. [3 Identification Needed]
    <<identifyCorals>>
    Cabbage Leather Coral: You...do?
    It looks at you in awe. Hopeful to have found a like-minded soul that understands it.
    -> Maybe we can just be two aliens...together?
        <<set $SWCoralPoints += 5>>
        <<update_coral_points_display>>
-> Well your friends are missing out. You're a real riot under that shy exterior!
    Cabbage Leather Coral smiles bashfully at your complement.

<<set $Speaker to "None">>
<<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
Your sweet moment is interrupted as the ocean current shifted, leading the coral next to Cabbage Leather Coral to nudge at them lightly.
Suddenly it was as if the ocean pressure doubled, crushing you with anxiety.
The warmth of the tropical waters could not be felt, as a toxins filled the water, coming from-- shockingly, Cabbage Leather Coral itself!
The shy, sweet coral seemingly dissipated, replaced by a scary, territorial leafy coral.
Did I mention scary? Cabbage Leather Coral became very, very scary.

<<set $Speaker to "CabbageCoral">>
<<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
Cabbage Leather Coral: DON'T TOUCH ME.
After a few moments, Cabbage Leather Coral snaps out of it's rageful trance. And the atmosphere was once again restored to it's sunny tropical state.

Cabbage Leather Coral: Sorry...where was I? I think I was a bit lost in the sauce there.
-> Uh, do you not remember?
    Cabbage Leather Coral: Remember what?
-> Okay wow, you're psycho!
    <<set $Speaker to "CabbageCoral_happy">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    Cabbage Leather Coral: Why would you say that about me!

You tell Cabbage Leather Coral about their little...episode.
Cabbage Leather Coral: Wait you're saying I have some sort of...defence mechanism?
Cabbage Leather Coral: That sprays toxic chemicals when I'm stressed?
Cabbage Leather Coral: And that's why my friends are so awkward around me? Because I'm scary when they come too close?
-> Pretty much, yeah.
    <<jump Become_friend>>
-> They're just being pansies! [3 Identification Needed]
    <<identifyCorals>>
    <<set $SWCoralPoints += 5>>
    <<update_coral_points_display>>
    It smiles a bit at your attempt to lighten the mood.
    <<jump Become_friend>>
-> I guess it was you after all.
    <<set $Speaker to "CabbageCoral_sad">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    Cabbage Leather Coral: Yea...I guess it was.

<<set $CLBranch3 = true>>
<<isCLBranch3>>
<<jump Cabbage_Coral_Node3>>
