        <<set $SWCoralPoints += 5>>
        <<update_coral_points_display>>
    -> Zzz...zzz...zzz...zzz
        <<set $Speaker to "GroovedBrainCoral">>
        <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
        The coral notices you dozing away but doesn't say anything. However it looks really dejected.
        Grooved Brain Coral: H..Hey, what about this? Look, its my favourite puzzle!
<<jump A_Box>>
<<endif>>
===

title: A_Box
position: -155,375
---
Grooved Brain Coral proudly pulled out a box and presented it to you.

Grooved Brain Coral: I CALL THIS...
<<set $Speaker to "GroovedBrainCoral_happy">>
<<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
Grooved Brain Coral: THE MAZE!!!
Grooved Brain Coral: This box descended upon me one day and I have been tinkering with it. I am now a master-mazer and will teach you a trick I learned.
It taught you a few tricks and persuaded you to give it a try.
-> You solve it in less than a minute.
    <<set $Speaker to "GroovedBrainCoral">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    Grooved Brain Coral: You solved it so fast, it's hard to believe this is your first time...
    Its vibrant colours had faded, and it looked dejected...
    <<set $Speaker to "None">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    You feel guilty, maybe you finished it too fast.
-> You solve it after 5 minutes.
    <<set $Speaker to "GroovedBrainCoral_happy">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    Grooved Brain Coral: Hey, that wasn't so bad! That was a great effort! With more practice you might be a master like me!
    It seemed happy and content!
    <<set $Speaker to "None">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    You feel glad both of you are having fun.
-> Let's offer a gift before we leave!
    <<GiveGift GroovedBrainCoral>>
    <<set $Speaker to "GroovedBrainCoral">>
    <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
    <<if LastGift() == "bouquet">>
        <<set $SWCoralPoints += 5>>
        <<update_coral_points_display>>
        <<set $Speaker to "GroovedBrainCoral_happy">>
        <<Update_CurrentSpeaker>>
        Grooved Brain Coral: Gasp! Is this for me??
        Grooved Brain Coral: These are my favourite! How did you know?
        Grooved Brain Coral: Thank you so much! Please excuse me as I feast on this delicacy!
        The coral is shaking with glee as it gobbles the food.
        <<returnToHome>>
    <<endif>>
    <<if LastGift() == "cabbage">>
        Grooved Brain Coral: This kinda.. are you saying this looks like me?
    <<elseif LastGift() == "sea_bass">>
        Grooved Brain Coral: I don't like this.. whatever it is.
    <<endif>>
    Grooved Brain Coral: And I thought we knew each other well enough.. Guess I was wrong.
    The coral is avoiding your gaze. It seems like you have done it this time...
    <<set $GBBranch3 = true>>
    <<isGBBranch3>>
    <<returnToHome>>
<<jump Grooved_Brain_Coral_Node3>>
